#: /Script/ShuttlegentCore.ShuttlegentAgentEntry [ScriptStruct ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,ShuttlegentAgentEntry"
msgid "Personal settings for one agent; the agents themselves come from the plugin and are not entered by hand."
msgstr "Personal settings for one agent; the agents themselves come from the plugin and are not entered by hand."

#. Key:	ShuttlegentAgentEntry:AgentId
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/ShuttlegentCore.ShuttlegentAgentEntry:AgentId [StrProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/ShuttlegentCore.ShuttlegentAgentEntry:AgentId [StrProperty ToolTip meta-data]
